WEBVTT

1
00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:18.450
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Tell me about your home town.

2
00:00:20.957 --> 00:00:25.522
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Well… it’s a small town in California.

3
00:00:26.486 --> 00:00:28.318
My parents have a farm there.

4
00:00:29.845 --> 00:00:30.890
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Is it nice?

5
00:00:32.786 --> 00:00:36.563
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> It’s very quiet, but I like it.

6
00:00:37.479 --> 00:00:38.572
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> What’s the weather like?

7
00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:44.069
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> It’s nice in the summer, but it’s really cold in the winter.

8
00:00:44.985 --> 00:00:46.013
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Does it snow?

9
00:00:46.447 --> 00:00:51.237
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Yeah, it does. We get a lot of snow.

10
00:00:51.494 --> 00:00:52.828
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> I love snow.

11
00:00:53.020 --> 00:00:53.888
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Me too.

12
00:00:55.479 --> 00:00:58.983
But my favourite time of the year is the fall.

13
00:00:59.787 --> 00:01:05.733
You say ‘autumn’, right? The fall is really beautiful.

14
00:01:06.762 --> 00:01:09.012
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Do you have any brothers or sisters?

15
00:01:09.703 --> 00:01:14.058
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> I have a sister. A twin sister, actually.

16
00:01:14.733 --> 00:01:17.594
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> A twin sister… that’s cool. What’s her name?

17
00:01:17.867 --> 00:01:21.178
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Emma. She’s great.

18
00:01:21.853 --> 00:01:22.930
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> What does she do?

19
00:01:23.396 --> 00:01:25.389
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> She works on my parents’ farm.

20
00:01:29.278 --> 00:01:33.569
What about you? Do you have any brothers or sisters?

21
00:01:34.148 --> 00:01:38.744
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> No. I don’t have any brothers or sisters. It’s only me.

22
00:01:47.729 --> 00:01:53.514
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Oh. It’s Jenny. She’s my aunt. She’s calling from the US.

23
00:01:53.530 --> 00:01:54.937
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Really? Answer it!

24
00:01:58.633 --> 00:01:59.967
<v><b>Jenny:</b></v> Hi, Ben.

25
00:02:00.144 --> 00:02:01.526
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Hey, Jenny.

26
00:02:01.960 --> 00:02:03.278
<v><b>Jenny:</b></v> How’s London?

27
00:02:03.431 --> 00:02:06.227
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Oh, it’s great.

28
00:02:06.693 --> 00:02:08.220
<v><b>Jenny:</b></v> What are you doing now?

29
00:02:08.622 --> 00:02:13.138
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> I’m sightseeing… and shopping.

30
00:02:13.620 --> 00:02:16.883
<v><b>Jenny:</b></v> Fantastic. Where are you?

31
00:02:17.140 --> 00:02:22.845
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> I’m… not sure exactly. I’m with a friend.

32
00:02:23.215 --> 00:02:27.827
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Hi, Jenny! We’re in Hackney. I’m Izzy. I’m Ben’s friend.

33
00:02:28.068 --> 00:02:29.274
<v><b>Jenny:</b></v> Oh, hi!

34
00:02:29.338 --> 00:02:34.079
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Don’t worry. Ben is fine. He’s with me. I’m showing him the city.

35
00:02:34.497 --> 00:02:38.258
<v><b>Jenny:</b></v> I’m happy to hear it! Have a great time, Ben.

36
00:02:38.290 --> 00:02:42.067
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> OK, thanks. Say ‘hi’ to Rob and the kids.

37
00:02:43.095 --> 00:02:43.835
<v><b>Jenny:</b></v> Bye!

38
00:02:44.397 --> 00:02:45.281
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Bye.

39
00:02:48.029 --> 00:02:52.144
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> She’s nice. Is she your mother’s sister?

40
00:02:52.192 --> 00:02:58.926
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Yeah, she is. She knows London really well. Her husband, Rob, is from here.

41
00:02:59.408 --> 00:03:00.260
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Oh, really?

42
00:03:00.903 --> 00:03:04.326
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Yeah. Rob’s great.

43
00:03:06.046 --> 00:03:07.701
He’s the love of her life.

44
00:03:11.430 --> 00:03:12.732
Listen, Izzy.

45
00:03:14.789 --> 00:03:19.016
My photography class has a little show next week.

46
00:03:22.085 --> 00:03:23.484
Do you want to come?

47
00:03:29.912 --> 00:03:33.416
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Um… I don’t know.

48
00:03:33.737 --> 00:03:36.309
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Oh, it’s OK. No problem.

49
00:03:37.595 --> 00:03:45.727
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> No… I’d love to come. Thanks.